      "status": "sourced",
      "note": "This year's principal and interest on the county's tax-supported debt (the debt booklet schedules a $6,517,537 payment; the budget appropriates $6,522,538). Behind that yearly payment: $70,025,000 of principal still outstanding as of Oct 1, 2025, or $96,508,940 counting all the interest still to come, paid down through 2044. Most of it is recent — a single 2024 certificate of obligation for $31.3M is about 42% of all the principal, and roughly tripled the county's debt. The county's bonds are rated AA+ (S&P) and Aa1 (Moody's). Full schedule: the county's Debt Service Booklet."
    },
